msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1420
msgid ""
"For more information See the :ref:`extensions user guide  <topics-"
"extensions>` and the :ref:`list of available extensions <topics-extensions-"
"ref>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1426
msgid "FEED_TEMPDIR"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1430
msgid ""
"The Feed Temp dir allows you to set a custom folder to save crawler "
"temporary files before uploading with :ref:`FTP feed storage <feed-storage-"
"ftp>` and :ref:`Amazon S3 <topics-feed-storage-s3>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1437
msgid "FEED_STORAGE_GCS_ACL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1439
msgid "Default: ``\"\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1441
msgid ""
"The Access Control List (ACL) used when storing items to :ref:`Google Cloud "
"Storage <topics-feed-storage-gcs>`. For more information on how to set this "
"value, please refer to the column *JSON API* in `Google Cloud documentation "
"<https://docs.cloud.google.com/storage/docs/access-control/lists>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1447
msgid "FORCE_CRAWLER_PROCESS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1451
msgid ""
"If ``False``, :ref:`Scrapy commands that need a CrawlerProcess <topics-"
"commands-crawlerprocess>`, when :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR_ENABLED` is set to "
"``True``, will decide between using :class:`scrapy.crawler."
"AsyncCrawlerProcess` and :class:`scrapy.crawler.CrawlerProcess` based on the "
"value of the :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR` setting, but ignoring its value in :"
"ref:`per-spider settings <spider-settings>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1459
msgid ""
"If ``True``, these commands will always use :class:`~scrapy.crawler."
"CrawlerProcess` when :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR_ENABLED` is set to ``True``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1463
msgid ""
"When :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR_ENABLED` is set to ``False``, :class:`~scrapy."
"crawler.AsyncCrawlerProcess` will be used in all cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1466
msgid ""
"Set this to ``True`` if you want to set :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR` to a non-"
"default value in :ref:`per-spider settings <spider-settings>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1469 ../../../topics/settings.rst:2139
#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:2153 ../../../topics/settings.rst:2201
#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:2295
msgid "This is a :ref:`pre-crawler setting <pre-crawler-settings>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1475
msgid "FTP_PASSIVE_MODE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1479
msgid ""
"Whether or not to use passive mode when initiating FTP transfers, unless "
"there is an ``\"ftp_passive\"`` key in ``Request`` meta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1492
msgid "FTP_PASSWORD"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1494
msgid "Default: ``\"guest\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1496
msgid ""
"The password to use for FTP connections when there is no "
"``\"ftp_password\"`` in ``Request`` meta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1500
msgid ""
"Paraphrasing `RFC 1635`_, although it is common to use either the password "
"\"guest\" or one's e-mail address for anonymous FTP, some FTP servers "
"explicitly ask for the user's e-mail address and will not allow login with "
"the \"guest\" password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1517
msgid "FTP_USER"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1519
msgid "Default: ``\"anonymous\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1521
msgid ""
"The username to use for FTP connections when there is no ``\"ftp_user\"`` in "
"``Request`` meta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1533
msgid "GCS_PROJECT_ID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1537
msgid ""
"The Project ID that will be used when storing data on `Google Cloud "
"Storage`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1542
msgid "HTTP2_MAX_FRAME_SIZE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1546
msgid "Default: ``16384``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1548
msgid ""
"Maximum `frame size`_, in bytes, that servers may send, between ``16384`` "
"and ``16777215``. Connections to servers that send a larger frame fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1551
msgid ""
"Raise it for servers that send larger frames regardless of this value. Note "
"that :setting:`DOWNLOAD_MAXSIZE` and :setting:`DOWNLOAD_WARNSIZE` are "
"checked once per received frame, so a higher value allows a response to "
"exceed them by more before being caught."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1556
msgid ""
":class:`~scrapy.core.downloader.handlers._httpx.HttpxDownloadHandler` "
"ignores this setting, as ``httpx`` does not allow configuring the frame size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1564
msgid "ITEM_PIPELINES"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1568
msgid ""
"A dict containing the item pipelines to use, and their orders. Order values "
"are arbitrary, but it is customary to define them in the 0-1000 range. Lower "
"orders process before higher orders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1572 ../../../topics/settings.rst:1878
#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:2195
msgid "Example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1574
msgid ""
"ITEM_PIPELINES = {\n"
"    \"mybot.pipelines.validate.ValidateMyItem\": 300,\n"
"    \"mybot.pipelines.validate.StoreMyItem\": 800,\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1584
msgid "ITEM_PIPELINES_BASE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1588
msgid ""
"A dict containing the pipelines enabled by default in Scrapy. You should "
"never modify this setting in your project, modify :setting:`ITEM_PIPELINES` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1594
msgid "ITEM_PROCESSOR"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1596
msgid "Default: ``\"scrapy.pipelines.ItemPipelineManager\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1598
msgid ""
"The :ref:`component <topics-components>` that builds the :ref:`item pipeline "
"<topics-item-pipeline>` from :setting:`ITEM_PIPELINES` and runs scraped "
"items through it. It must implement :class:`~scrapy.pipelines."
"ItemProcessorProtocol`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1609
msgid "JOBDIR"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1613
msgid ""
"A string indicating the directory for storing the state of a crawl when :ref:"
"`pausing and resuming crawls <topics-jobs>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1620
msgid "LOG_COLOR"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:1624
msgid ""
