"as when the ``scrapy`` CLI program is invoked or when using the :class:"
"`~scrapy.crawler.AsyncCrawlerProcess` class or the :class:`~scrapy.crawler."
"CrawlerProcess` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/settings.rst:2316
msgid ""
